{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1447012-solar-lore-revamp","id":1447012,"title":"Solar Lore Revamp","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-02T11:42:42-07:00","id":1447012,"title":"Solar Lore Revamp","content":"Lore is now redone.<br /> <br /> Lore, like some other abilities, suffered from poor wording and definitions. I\u2019ve tightened up the meanings behind fact rolls and knowledge rolls and gave them a list of sample difficulties and penalties. I\u2019ve also clarified what \u201ccommon\u201d knowledge a character typically knows, guidelines of how specialties can work in your game, and how one can retry a failed knowledge check.<br /> <br /> Charm wise there are a total of 23 charms in this rewrite, just a little under half of the 47 in the original book. A lot of dice tricks were pruned and replaced with charms that enable more horizontal rather than vertical power and are brought into line with current trends for the game line (I.E. teaching charms). Wyld-Shaping is now two entire charms for example.<br /> <br /> Lastly, for modern or sci-fi games, I\u2019ve included a collection of Computer related charms. They can work with attached subsystem, or just have many of them work with a far more simplistic system \u201croll to see if you pass/fail\u201d.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iY9UOE8tC2qmM10kBfAhy6fHI-n3nq_DaBEs6z1se6Y/edit\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iY9UOE8tC2qmM10kBfAhy6fHI-n3nq_DaBEs6z1se6Y/edit\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"h