g Prana</div> </div> </div> </div>It's much better. Isn't the upgrade a little much though? At the very least is appropriate for a supernal solar to get a free second circle demon equivlant with no drawback?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T09:40:11-07:00","id":1447215,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1447012-solar-lore-revamp?p=1447173#post1447173\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's much better. Isn't the upgrade a little much though? At the very least is appropriate for a supernal solar to get a free second circle demon equivlant with no drawback?</div> </div> </div> </div>There's some conditions. First you need someone with a defining intimacy towards the Solar, enlighten them, wait an entire story, have them play a major role in a story, then pop it again, and then wait anywhere between a month or another story. This could be a long time spent waiting.<br /> <br /> Getting 2CD's early on was one of the concerns I have to judge, but my thoughts is that Essence 3 is a midpoint that's reached in most games (Unlike ESS 5), and once someone is there they can just demon spam all they want.<br /> <br /> Plus with a cap of (Essence) only, I'm hoping it doesn't get out of hand. 2CD's are powerful, but an Essence 2 Solar whose niche is in the same area is probably going to be learning the charms that will allow them to be just as good, if not better.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":1183,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","user":"Sandact6","date":". 05-03-2021, 12:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T09:50:56-07:00","id":1447220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sandact6</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1447012-solar-lore-revamp?p=1447215#post1447215\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There's some conditions. First you need someone with a defining intimacy towards the Solar, enlighten them, have them play a major role in a story, then pop it again. If you're in the middle of a story, then a month could be some time.<br /> <br /> Getting 2CD's early on was one of the concerns I have to judge, but my thoughts is that Essence 3 is a midpoint that's reached in most games (Unlike ESS 5), and once someone is there they can just demon spam all they want.<br /> <br /> Plus with a cap of (Essence) only, I'm hoping it doesn't get out of hand. 2CD's are powerful, but an Essence 2 Solar whose niche is in the same area is probably going to be learning the charms that will allow them to be just as good, if not better.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm. Why not have a minimum charm requirement that extends outside of supernal like circle sorcery? Also maybe limited to 1 or 2 if not. 2nd circle demons have pretty big limitations compared to a completely devoided being. When you tell a second circle to do something it won't ever do in the exact way you want it to. It still follows it's own rules and still does things in possibly inconvenant ways. With this charm you get an absolutely devoted being without any drawback.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T10:19:06-07:00","id":1447226,"title":"","content":"The main weakness with this charm is the number. You can have up to 15 2CD's following you in theory. This charm? It can only be (Essence). That's a hell of a gap, but I think it's an acceptable downside. Demons can also be summoned once per month, no fuss beyond the binding roll. These guys have a very long windup in comparison.<br /> <br /> I could make the repurchase effect into Supernal-No rather easily. I thought that the above factors would balance it out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T10:41:35-07:00","id":1447230,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sandact6</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1447012-solar-lore-revamp?p=1447226#post1447226\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The main weakness with this charm is the number. You can have up to 15 2CD's following you in theory. This charm? It can only be (Essence). That's a hell of a gap, but I think it's an acceptable downside. Demons can also be summoned once per month, no fuss beyond the binding roll. These guys have a very long windup in comparison.<br /> <br /> I could make the repurchase effect into Supernal-No rather easily. I thought that the above factors would balance it out.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do think it's very different. Demons can cause a host of issues in creation just by being in creation. They also can fuck shit up for the sorcerer if the sorcerer tells them to do something and they do it their own way. Like say mnemon tasks octavian to take the near by village, octavian will probably kill everyone doing it. Just because it's within it's nature. With this charm you get a being that's an extension of a solars will rather then an independent actor who is being forced to do something but has enough leeway to fuck things up. <br /> <br /> Even one of these is stronger then 15 2CD. Because those 15 beings have their own way of doing things that'll be counter productive or harmful for the sorcerer if they don't pick ajd choose carefully.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T13:26:09-07:00","id":1447254,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1447012-solar-lore-revamp?p=1447230#post1447230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I do think it's very different. Demons can cause a host of issues in creation just by being in creation. They also can fuck shit up for the sorcerer if the sorcerer tells them to do something and they do it their own way. Like say mnemon tasks octavian to take the near by village, octavian will probably kill everyone doing it. Just because it's within it's nature. With this charm you get a being that's an extension of a solars will rather then an independent actor who is being forced to do something but has enough leeway to fuck things up.<br /> <br /> Even one of these is stronger then 15 2CD. Because those 15 beings have their own way of doing things that'll be counterproductive or harmful for the sorcerer if they don't pick ajd choose carefully.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes I understand that, and the downside built into these are (1) It takes some time to create them and (2) you aren't able to summon as many. I get that these are more interpretive than demons or how higher essence elementals do things, but that's an upside of the charm over normal demon summoning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T13:48:09-07:00","id":1447259,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sandact6</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1447012-solar-lore-revamp?p=1447254#post1447254\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes I understand that, and the downside built into these are (1) It takes some time to create them and (2) you aren't able to summon as many. I get that these are more interpretive than demons or how higher essence elementals do things, but that's an upside of the charm over normal demon summoning.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure but is 5 in general let alone at start seems excessive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T15:51:53-07:00","id":1447283,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1447012-solar-lore-revamp?p=1447259#post1447259\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sure but is 5 in general let alone at start seems excessive.</div> </div> </div> </div>Supernal counts your essence as 5 for the purposes of charm prequisites and enhancement effects (I.E. if a charm says &quot;At Essence 3+ you may do X&quot; then you can do it immediately). However charms that say &quot;Do things up to (Essence)&quot; means you use your natural Essence for the purposes of that effect.<br /> <br /> This means you'd only have two at start (Given the time required, I'd be surprised if you get one before Essence 2)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T15:59:29-07:00","id":1447287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sandact6</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1447012-solar-lore-revamp?p=1447283#post1447283\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Supernal counts your essence as 5 for the purposes of charm prequisites and enhancement effects (I.E. if a charm says &quot;At Essence 3+ you may do X&quot; then you can do it immediately). However charms that say &quot;Do things up to (Essence)&quot; means you use your natural Essence for the purposes of that effect.<br /> <br /> This means you'd only have two at start (Given the time required, I'd be surprised if you get one before Essence 2)</div> </div> </div> </div>Would it really be that difficult? Personally, I'd limit it to (Essence/2) but tbh I've never seen anything more then one or two 2cd in play at any given time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}